DESCRIPTION:GROCERY SHOPPING LIST\n==================================================\n\n• Beef: 350 gram\n• Carrot: 1 unit\n• Cauliflower: 0.5 unit\n• Chestnut: 0.5 cup\n• Chicken Thighs: 2 unit\n• Chinese Ham Sausage: 1 unit\n• Chopped Whole Chicken: 500 g\n• Corn: 0.5 cup\n• Corn Flour: 50 g\n• Curry Block: 1 block\n• Diced Pepper: 1 unit\n• Egg: 1 unit\n• Firm Tofu: 1 block\n• Fish: 1 unit\n• Flour: 50 g\n• Garlic: 3 big clove\n• Garlic Powder: 1 tablespoon\n• Garlic Sprouts: 3 unit\n• Ginger: 5 thin piece\n• Green Onion: 3 unit\n• Green Onions: 3 unit\n• Green Pepper: 1 unit\n• Olive Oil: 20 ml\n• Oyster Sauce: 2 tablespoon\n• Paprika: 1 tablespoon\n• Peeled And Seeded Sweet Pumpkin: 600 gram\n• Pixian Doubanjiang: 1 tablespoon\n• Rice: 2 cup\n• Salt: 1 teaspoon\n• Sesame Oil: 3.5 tablespoon\n• Shiitake Mushroom: 4 unit\n• Soy Sauce: 11 tablespoon\n• Soybean Paste: 2 tablespoon\n• Sugar: 1 tablespoon\n• Tomatoes: 10 unit\n• Vegetable Oil: 5 tablespoon\n• Vinegar: 2 tablespoon\n• Warm Water: 80 g\n• White Sesame: 1 tablespoon\n• White Sugar: 50 gram\n• Any Vegetables Or Proteins: as needed\n• Cilantro: as needed\n• Goji Berries: as needed\n• Hot Pepper Sauce: as needed\n• Oil: as needed\n• Pepper: as needed\n• Red Dates: as needed\n• Scallions: as needed\n• Sweet Potato Vermicelli: as needed\n• Dried Mushrooms: Any (shiitake mushrooms\, bamboo fungus\, cordyceps flower\, tea tree mushrooms\, morels\, chanterelles\, king oyster mushrooms)\n• Starch: a pinch\n\nTotal ingredients: 51
